# This repository is a byte-pinned evidence bundle: MANIFEST.sha256 hashes the
# exact committed bytes of every tracked file. Disable all end-of-line
# conversion so a checkout is byte-identical on every platform and
# `sha256sum -c MANIFEST.sha256` passes everywhere (including Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true, which would otherwise rewrite text files to CRLF).
* -text
